# Bazel
bazel-*
.bazelrc.user
MODULE.bazel.lock

# Vivarium per-checkpoint renders are DEBUG OUTPUT, not deliverables. 16516 tracked PNGs
# (397 MB) made pushing to origin take longer than most of the experiments. Curated result
# figures live in docs/figures/ and stay tracked; the rest regenerate from a seed.
# NOTE: this shrinks future checkouts, NOT history -- the objects remain in past commits.
projects/vivarium/docs/images/*.png
